@startuml
allowmixing
title Paquetes actuales (vista simplificada)
package "presentation" {
  package "controllers" {
    class GameController
  }
  package "testing" {
    class MechanicsTestApp
    class MechanicsTestSetupPanel
    class MechanicsTestConfiguration
    class MechanicsTestPanel
    class MechanicsTestController
    class PresentationMovement
  }
  package "screens / components / navigation" as UI
}
package "domain" {
  class Game
  class GameSession
  class SessionParticipant
  class Ball
  class TypeOfMatch
  package "hitbox" {
    interface Hitbox
    class CircularHitbox
    class RectangularHitbox
    class HitboxIntersections
  }
  class StatusEffect
  abstract class Power
  class BlueAura
  class Lightning
  class Tornado
  class Illusion
  class PowerFactory
  class GameException
  enum Action
  class ByGoals
  class ByTime
  class SoccerField
  package "domain" {
    class CollisionFacade
    class CourtGeometry
    class BallCollisionResolver
    class BallParticipantCollisionResolver
  }
}
GameController ..> Game
GameController ..> GameSession
GameController ..> SessionParticipant
Game ..> GameSession
GameSession ..> TypeOfMatch
GameSession ..> SoccerField
SoccerField ..> CollisionFacade
CollisionFacade ..> CourtGeometry
CollisionFacade ..> BallCollisionResolver
CollisionFacade ..> BallParticipantCollisionResolver
Ball ..> CircularHitbox
SessionParticipant ..> RectangularHitbox
SoccerField ..> RectangularHitbox
HitboxIntersections ..> Hitbox
SessionParticipant ..> StatusEffect
SessionParticipant ..> Power
PowerFactory ..> Power
UI ..> GameController : futuras llamadas desde UI
MechanicsTestPanel ..> MechanicsTestController
MechanicsTestSetupPanel ..> MechanicsTestConfiguration
MechanicsTestApp ..> MechanicsTestSetupPanel
MechanicsTestApp ..> MechanicsTestPanel
MechanicsTestPanel ..> MechanicsTestConfiguration
MechanicsTestPanel ..> Game : vista inmutable
MechanicsTestController ..> Game
PresentationMovement ..> Game
note bottom of UI
  Las pantallas de la aplicación principal aún son esqueletos.
  El banco de pruebas es una aplicación independiente.
end note
note right of GameController
  Puente de la presentación oficial:
  recibe acciones de la interfaz y las
  delega al dominio. La partida oficial
  todavía no está integrada por completo.
end note
note bottom of GameSession
  Coordina una partida: guarda cancha,
  participantes, marcador y modalidad.
  Coordina movimiento, goles, validaciones
  de participantes y final de partida.
  SoccerField delega la física en CollisionFacade dentro de domain.
end note
note bottom of Hitbox
  Las formas geométricas implementan Hitbox.
  Ball, SessionParticipant y SoccerField
  contienen formas asociadas sin implementar
  la interfaz.
end note
note right of MechanicsTestController
  Controla el banco de pruebas a través
  de Game y su instantánea SessionView.
  PresentationMovement usa Game para
  mover y preparar participantes.
end note
@enduml
